WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.300
1886 — the first recorded XI

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.800
1954 — eleven timed goals

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.600
2008 — eleven marks decide it

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.600
1968 ↔ 2008 — the same summit

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:22.600
Both No. 7. Both scored.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.600
1999 — eleven days, no margin

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:40.300
Three must-wins. Every winner from the bench.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:48.300
Fergie time — the same late shape

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:52.600
671 goals after 85′

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:57.300
6,028 matches — pull a thread

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:00.000
Every claim leads back to its receipt
